d) All of the above



Which of the following is a sign or symptom of withdrawal from alcohol?
a) Hallucinations
b) Sweating
c) Seizures
d) All of the above
d) All of the above



Which of the following is true concerning a patient's reaction to toxic gases from smoke inhalation?
